## System Architecture

### Main Loop Structure

```cpp
void loop() {
    lv_task_handler();        // LVGL event processing
    SensorHandler();          // Accelerometer, gestures
    PMUHandler();             // Power management
    get_BattVoltage();        // Battery monitoring
    app_batt_voltage_update(); // Update battery app
    check_alarm();            // Alarm monitoring
    check_timer();            // Timer monitoring
    lowPowerEnergyHandler();  // Sleep mode (30s timeout)
}
```

### App System Architecture

All apps follow the `app_t` structure:

```cpp
typedef struct {
    app_func_t setup_func_cb;  // Called when app loads
    app_func_cb exit_func_cb;   // Called when app exits
    void *user_data;           // App-specific data
} app_t;
```

### Power Management

- **Active Mode**: Full brightness, all sensors active
- **Light Sleep**: Screen off after 30 seconds of inactivity
- **Wake Methods**: Touch screen, accelerometer interrupt, PMU interrupt
- **Background Operations**: Alarms and timers continue running during sleep

